OL,3,ACanada welcomes EU proposal to become
OL,4,A'associate member'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump earlier
OL,7,Fcalled the idea "laughable" and
OL,8,Fthreatened "very serious tariffs" on
OL,9,FEurope if he considered it a "hostile
OL,10,Fact".
